<section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="ambush-predators" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Ambush Predators</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="counterpredation" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-deathleaper&quot;,&quot;unit-lictor&quot;,&quot;unit-neurolictor&quot;,&quot;unit-von-ryans-leapers&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;targeted-by-enemy-attack&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-counterpredation">Counterpredation</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Fight phase, when a friendly DEATHLEAPER/LICTOR/NEUROLICTOR/VON RYAN’S LEAPERS unit is selected to fight.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>That DEATHLEAPER/LICTOR/NEUROLICTOR/VON RYAN’S LEAPERS unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Your unit’s attacks that target a hidden unit have +1 S and AP.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="hypersensory-adaptations" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-deathleaper&quot;,&quot;unit-lictor&quot;,&quot;unit-neurolictor&quot;,&quot;unit-von-ryans-leapers&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-hypersensory-adaptations">Hypersensory Adaptations</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>Start of your Shooting phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One friendly DEATHLEAPER/LICTOR/NEUROLICTOR/VON RYAN’S LEAPERS unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Select one visible enemy unit within 12&quot; of your unit. That enemy unit has +6&quot; detection range.</p></article><article class="stratagem surface" data-rule-id="scanner-gheist" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-deathleaper&quot;,&quot;unit-lictor&quot;,&quot;unit-neurolictor&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[&quot;not-within-engagement-range&quot;]}"><div class="stratagem-head"><div><h3><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-stratagem-scanner-gheist">Scanner Gheist</button></h3></div><div class="cp">1CP</div></div><p class="field"><b>When</b><br>End of your opponent’s Fight phase.</p><p class="field"><b>Target</b><br>One friendly unengaged DEATHLEAPER/LICTOR/NEUROLICTOR unit.</p><p class="field"><b>Effect</b><br>Place your unit in strategic reserves.</p></article></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="encircling-horrors" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-lictor&quot;,&quot;unit-neurolictor&quot;,&quot;unit-von-ryans-leapers&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-encircling-horrors">Encircling Horrors</button></h4><p>NEUROLICTOR/LICTOR/VON RYAN’S LEAPERS unit only. In your opponent’s Movement phase, when an enemy unit ends a move within 8&quot; of this unit, this unit can make a normal move of up to D3+3&quot;.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="cryptophotaic-camouflage" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-von-ryans-leapers&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-cryptophotaic-camouflage">Cryptophotaic Camouflage</button></h4><p>VON RYAN’S LEAPERS unit only. This unit has -3&quot; detection range.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="assimilation-swarm" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Assimilation Swarm</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-biophagic-flow-aura" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 10 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-biophagic-flow-aura">Biophagic Flow (Aura)</button></h4><p>Tyranids model only. While a friendly Harvester model is within 12&quot; of the bearer, when using the Feed the Swarm ability, that Harvester model can Regenerate one friendly Tyranids unit that is within 9&quot; instead of one within 6&quot;.</p></article><articl