ck is allocated to the bearer, it can use this ability. If it does, until the end of the phase, the bearer has the Feel No Pain 5+ ability against Psychic Attacks.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-ominous-presence" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-tyrannocyte&quot;,&quot;unit-carnifexes&quot;,&quot;unit-exocrine&quot;,&quot;unit-harpy&quot;,&quot;unit-haruspex&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-crone&quot;,&quot;unit-maleceptor&quot;,&quot;unit-mawloc&quot;,&quot;unit-norn-assimilator&quot;,&quot;unit-norn-emissary&quot;,&quot;unit-psychophage&quot;,&quot;unit-screamer-killer&quot;,&quot;unit-sporocyst&quot;,&quot;unit-toxicrene&quot;,&quot;unit-trygon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyrannofex&quot;,&quot;unit-harridan&quot;,&quot;unit-hierophant&quot;,&quot;unit-barbed-hierodule&quot;,&quot;unit-dimachaeron&quot;,&quot;unit-scythed-hierodule&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 15 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-ominous-presence">Ominous Presence</button></h4><p>Tyranids Monster only. Add 3 to the bearer's Objective Control characteristic.</p></article></div></section><section class="related-detachment" data-detachment="invasion-fleet" data-keyword-grants="[]"><h2>Invasion Fleet</h2><div data-related-kind="stratagems"></div><div data-related-kind="enhancements"><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-adaptive-biology" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 25 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-adaptive-biology">Adaptive Biology</button></h4><p>Tyranids model only. The bearer has the Feel No Pain 5+ ability. At the start of any turn, if the bearer has fewer than its starting number of wounds remaining, until the end of the battle, it has the Feel No Pain 4+ ability instead.</p></article><article class="enhancement surface" data-rule-id="enhancement-alien-cunning" data-eligibility="{&quot;v&quot;:1,&quot;roles&quot;:[{&quot;id&quot;:&quot;friendly-target&quot;,&quot;side&quot;:&quot;friendly&quot;,&quot;subject&quot;:&quot;unit&quot;,&quot;count&quot;:1,&quot;selector&quot;:{&quot;unitIds&quot;:[&quot;unit-broodlord&quot;,&quot;unit-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-hyperadapted-raveners&quot;,&quot;unit-neurotyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-parasite-of-mortrex&quot;,&quot;unit-tervigon&quot;,&quot;unit-tyranid-prime-with-lash-whip&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-hive-tyrant&quot;,&quot;unit-winged-tyranid-prime&quot;,&quot;unit-malanthrope&quot;],&quot;noneKeywords&quot;:[&quot;EPIC HERO&quot;]}}],&quot;conditions&quot;:[]}"><div class="eyebrow">Enhancement · 30 pts</div><h4><button class="term-button" data-term="tyranids-enhancement-alien-cunning">Alien Cunning</button></h4><p>Tyranids model only. After both players have deployed their armies, select up to three Tyranids units from your army and redeploy them. When doing so, you can set those units up in Strategic Reserves if you wish